<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60699" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύ̆λινδρ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rolling stone, tumbler</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				2.283
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.594
			</span></i>, Veget.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Mil.</u>
				4.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Carm.Aur.</u>
				57
			</span></i>; a child's <i>marble</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).462
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>roller, cylinder</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				155
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Mech.
				10.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.682d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				3546.9
			</span></i> (Pergam.); <i>pivot,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				11(2).287
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				115
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ
				σφαίρας καὶ κ.</span>, title of work by Archimedes.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>roll of a book, volume</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				10.26
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> name of a
			fabulous stone, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Fluv.</u>
				19.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b> fiery
				<i>envelope</i> of the axis of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόσμος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Herm.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.49.44
			</span></i>.</div>
